flowchart TD
    A[Source Code] -->|Compile with -g| B[Binary with Debug Symbols]
    B -->|gdb ./program| C[GDB Session]
    C -->|break main| D[Set Breakpoint]
    D -->|run| E[Execute Until Breakpoint]
    E -->|step/next| F[Step Through Code]
    F -->|print var| G[Inspect Variables]
    G -->|backtrace| H[View Stack Trace]
    H -->|continue| I[Resume Execution]
    I -->|Crash/Exit| J[Post-Mortem Analysis]
    J -->|quit| K[End Session]
    
    style B fill:#e1f5ff
    style C fill:#fff4e1
    style G fill:#e8f5e8
